e":"Repeat","start":544,"end":576,"description":"WD 8"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Homotetramer; dimer of dimers (PubMed:21240272). Component of the N-Cor repressor complex, at least composed of NCOR1, NCOR2, HDAC3, TBL1X, TBL1R, CORO2A and GPS2 (PubMed:10809664, PubMed:21240272). Interacts with GPS2 (when sumoylated); leading to protect GPS2 against degradation by the proteasome (PubMed:24943844). Component of a E3 ubiquitin ligase complex containing UBE2D1, SIAH1, CACYBP/SIP, SKP1, APC and TBL1X (PubMed:11389839). Probably part of other corepressor complexes, that do not contain NCOR1 and NCOR2. Interacts with histones H2B, H3a and H4. Interacts with MECP2; recruits TBL1X to the heterochromatin foci (By similarity). Interacts with USP44 (PubMed:27880911)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"O60907-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":526,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000380961.5","ENST00000424279.6"],"refseq":["NM_001139467.1","NM_001139468.1"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001132939.1","NP_001132940.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,52,526]],"edits":[{"start":1,"end":51,"original":"MTELAGASSSCCHRPAGRGAMQSVLHHFQRLRGREGGSHF","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":51,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-O60907-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-O60907-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":87.9,"plddt":[[50,1],[70,2],[90,15],[70,4],[50,1],[90,2],[70,1],[90,8],[70,4],[90,1],[70,5],[90,1],[70,1],[90,11],[70,16],[50,6],[70,8],[90,1],[70,30],[50,7],[0,35],[50,1],[0,1],[50,3],[70,1],[90,44],[70,2],[50,2],[0,2],[50,2],[70,2],[90,5],[70,13],[90,19],[70,1],[90,16],[70,1],[90,250],[70,1]],"losingConfidence":0}}],"ensemblGenes":["ENSG00000101849.19"],"unmapped":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[]},"coding":{"genes":1,"gencode":22,"mapped":20},"explorer":{"gene":null,"isoforms":"TBL1X"},"locus":"chrX:9463258-9719740","exons":{"tra